## Setup Secrets
1. Copy k8s/secrets/app-secrets.example.yaml to k8s/secrets/app-secrets.yaml
2. Generate Gmail App Password from Google Account → Security → App Passwords
3. Base64 encode your credentials:
   powershell "[Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes('your-password'))"
4. Replace placeholders in app-secrets.yaml with your encoded values
5. kubectl apply -f k8s/secrets/app-secrets.yaml

## Setup

1. Copy `application.example.yml` to `application.yml` in each service
2. Fill in your actual credentials
3. Generate JWT secret: `openssl rand -base64 32`
4. Run infrastructure: `docker compose up -d`
5. Start each service in IntelliJ
